                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of comedo, a skin blemish, a type of acne vulgaris, where a pore becomes clogged with a dark, hard, cheesy keratin-filled substance forming a hard black \\\"head\\\" on the skin's surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
